            "detailed_description": "Help the astronaut mice escape the giant neon snakes, and score some points while you're at it!<br><br>A new take on the classic &quot;Snake&quot; concept, <i>SoaEP</i> is a small game for the HTC Vive, and other SteamVR headsets, that'll really get your arms swinging!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steam Leaderboards support - Compete with your friends!<br></li><li><strong>[COMING SOON]</strong>Achievements! - Get arbitrary rewards for arbitrary tasks!<br></li><li>Neon Snakes! - Glowy, pink and long!<br></li><li>Powerups! - Make the snakes flee or slow down!<br></li><li>Music by Kevin McLeod, the genius at Incompetech!<br></li><li>Space Rodents! - What more could you possibly want? They've got tiny jetpacks!</li></ul>",
